Package: mageml
Title: Run R Blocks in Mage ML Pipelines
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("jospablo777", email = "jospablo777@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The runtime of R blocks in Mage ML pipelines. It exchanges data
    frames with Python blocks through Arrow IPC files, keeping 64-bit
    integers, lists, dates and time zones, connects to the databases of a
    Mage project's io_config.yaml through DBI, and reads and writes data
    files locally and on S3.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.3)
Imports:
    arrow,
    bit64,
    jsonlite,
    tibble,
    tools,
    utils
Suggests:
    blob,
    DBI,
    duckdb,
    RMariaDB,
    RPostgres,
    readr,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
